---
title: "The Idealist Me"
date: 2025-11-20T17:57:23+11:00
draft: true
---

To be an idealist is to have a certain kind of belief. To believe that the world can be better and that by doing the right thing, we can make it better. I'm an idealist and I believe that noble cause leads to great achievements. Take Wikipedia for example, a project with the pure aim of creating a large, comprehensive and accurate source of information that is accessible for everyone. I would say that Wikipedia have succeeded in their goals monumentally and is now one of the best and open source of information one can use to educate themselves.

